 private static double[] rotate(double x,double z,Direction f){return switch(f){case NORTH->new double[]{-x,-z};case EAST->new double[]{z,-x};case WEST->new double[]{-z,x};default->new double[]{x,z};};}
 public static BlockPos cell(BlockPos root,Direction f,int i){int[] c=CELLS[i];double[] p=rotate(c[0],c[2],f);return root.offset((int)p[0],c[1],(int)p[1]);}
 public static BlockPos root(BlockPos p,Direction f,int i){BlockPos offset=cell(BlockPos.ZERO,f,i);return p.offset(-offset.getX(),-offset.getY(),-offset.getZ());}
 public static VoxelShape shape(Direction f,int i){return SHAPES[f.get2DDataValue()][i];}
